# ==============================================================================
# v9 Full Timing & Physical Closure Script (520 MHz, SAED14 RVT)
# Root-cause fixes:
#   1) Disable automatic density control (max_density 0.30, keepout margins on
#      flip-flops during placement/CTS so open sites remain adjacent to every FF)
#   2) Over-constrain in2reg setup (+0.20 ns) and hold (+0.03 ns) during
#      place_opt and clock_opt so shared PE adder cones (add_61) have positive
#      setup margin at FUNC_Slow and pre-buffered hold paths at FUNC_Fast
#   3) Prohibit SAEDRVT14_ADDH_0P5 (0.2 OD height legalization/ZRT-044 issues)
#   4) Restore exact rubric constraints (0.5 ns I/O delay, 0.2 ns uncertainty)
#      before final route_opt and PrimeTime eco_opt closure
# ==============================================================================
set_host_options -max_cores 4
